    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1819">

                <pb facs="1188" n="1072" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1072"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 871.001/6.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Vopicka.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 12, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The President is cabling to Queen Elizabeth appropriate condolence on death of
                    the King. You will convey to the Council <pb facs="1189" n="1073"
                        xml:id="pg1073"/> of Ministers for Foreign Affairs the sorrow felt by the
                    Government of the United States on the lamentable death of his Majesty, the
                    King, and my own personal sympathy in this great bereavement which has befallen
                    Roumania.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
